            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Silence, you alright?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I'm alright."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#1",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Why are you over here now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#1",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Cause you've been over here for ages. Just checking in."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#1",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Eep. That wine bottle there... you're drinking now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#1",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Just a little."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Director Muelsyse?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "She's still back there waiting for us."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Where are you in the story?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Up until Anthony started trusting Kafka to help him. She also told me some stuff about what went down between Control and Saria."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Did she now?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Want me to tell you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#1",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "No. Not necessary for the time being."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "You look like you're doing terrible. Was it some bad crap Director Muelsyse told you about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "No... though it was, in a sense."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I'm... I can't put it straight."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "My mind is in disarray. I have some regrets. I feel as though I may have done something I am not equipped to do."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "You mean this whole breakout?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Yes."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I should apologize to you, Mayer."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "What for?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I shouldn't have gotten you involved. I was too cowardly. I couldn't bear it, and I told you about all this. I made you assume responsibility with me."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Whoa, I don't really mind, y'know. The fact you could trust me makes me pretty freakin' happy, Silence."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "And I mean, really, all I've done is take a trip back to Columbia with you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Actually, there's something I haven't told you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "What is it?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Behind this incident, behind HydeBro, is the Energy Section."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#3",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Huh? Energy?!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "You and the rest of Engineering are so closely tied with Energy, I'd been unsure whether I should tell you."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Oh... Hm, I'm fine, really. We're pretty tied up work-wise with Energy, yeah, but honestly, I'm not the world's biggest fan of their section."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Or more I'm, like, kinda terrified of Energy's director..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "What's the Director of Energy like?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Nngh? Haven't met more than a few times, but sometimes he comes over to our end just to see. He'll drop in on our meetings, too."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "He opens his mouth and you go 'wow, he's a big, smart cookie,' but he gives off this kinda feeling like..."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "I don't know how to capture it. He, like, cares more about what our stuff can be used to make, or what it can be exchanged for, things like that."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#1",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I see..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "And, like, since Saria took all the blame and resigned, it feels like us and the Energy Section got, like, even more tied up in each other."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "All these times some kinda weird work got scheduled and I couldn't even do any of my own crap."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "And that's why I wanted a chance to send myself off to Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Even if Closure's a little weird too, I'm way happier just doing my work at Rhodes."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#2",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "So that's it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3",
            "name2": "char_242_mayer#4",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mayer",
        "text": "Anyways, don't worry about me too much, Silence. In fact, I feel like you've done something good. Right?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Something good..."
    },
    {
        "command": "dialog"
    },
    {
