    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "blocker",
        "params": {
            "a": 0,
            "r": 0,
            "g": 0,
            "b": 0,
            "fadetime": 1,
            "block": true
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 1.5
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "This intel and analysis you have provided is extremely valuable. It compels me to note your viewpoint strongly, Operator Silence."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "In that case..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But first of all, this intel's origins are clearly internal to Rhine Lab. Divulging internal intelligence to third parties without permission inspires me not to place trust in you."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "However, from your behavior, I can trust you are in no way an imprudent person. Therefore, I require an explanation."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "This is intel I arrived at through collection and analysis via my own personal channels. It has no direct relation to Rhine Lab."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "But your discovery of a matter like this should've prompted submission to internal channels, to be dealt with there. Rhodes Island has no capacity to adjudicate this incident."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "No. I had no expectation that Rhodes Island would be able to."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I simply wanted to aid this person. I wanted to hear your viewpoint."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Why mine? Or should I say, why Rhodes Island?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "As of now, I trust Rhodes Island more than I do Rhine Lab."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What of Rhine Lab are you skeptical about?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "I don't know. I don't even know what it is I'm skeptical of."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "But I've come to work here for a very long while, now. I've seen with my own eyes what Rhodes Island is doing. I, at the least, KNOW what Rhodes Island is doing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "What you see may not be what you get, Operator Silence."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Moreover, it may be that you haven't noticed, but from your intel, it is very likely this Feline named Anthony was only immediately arrested the next state over as a setup by his father."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "In all likelihood, a situation they'd arranged long beforehand."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "But Anthony still hasn't been released to this day. He's already been stewing in that prison for six years. It's all the more likely he'll be in there forever."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Why are you placing such importance on a person who has nothing to do with you?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "Because I want to see clearly, once and for all, just what kind of company the Rhine Lab I've served all this time is."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "......"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You may be disappointed."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#3"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "But it'll be far better than knowing nothing."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "You are greatly persuasive, Operator Silence."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "Rhodes Island cannot provide you any outward assistance whatsoever, but I can, from a personal standpoint, provide you my viewpoint."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "I hope you are able to maintain your notion from start to finish."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_108_silent_1#5"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Silence",
        "text": "What notion?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_003_kalts_1"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kal'tsit",
        "text": "The notion that you are doing something good."
    },
    {
