    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "delay",
        "value": 2
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Mina."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Mm-hm."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Phew. Finally found a chance to talk to you. How's your results?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Following what you said, I've been spendin' this whole time ascertainin' this prison's structure on the down-low. Already got a general grasp of it now."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Helps the prison turnkeys're lax, but structure's tight. I feel like gettin' out's a pretty tall order..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#3",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "No problem, Boblem. There's always a way."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "How's about your end, then?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "I'm tapped in with Anthony. Turns out he had an idea for leaving in the first place, so we'll be following PLAN-A operations, helpin' him break out."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "We'll treat the clinic as our secret base from here on. I told Dr. Domma there about you. Just head right over, and you'll be good."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "So that's it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "What? You're a snap away from meeting the big guy who's been on your brain. Why d'ya look so flat?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "I'm not. I've seen him from far away a bunch of times. I feel like the big guy's kind of different to the one who saved my family once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Huh, I see. What did he used to be like?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "He used to be... a little more, ermm... cool?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "That's a way to phrase it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Once after I learned he saved 'em all, I went to see him all secret. He was plenty more cheery 'n' open than he is now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "What way? Was he that kinda big, splashy guy? The kid with like ten or so bodyguards fannin' from his heels?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "No, no... um... he was like, a bit more... I'm not sure how you describe it..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "I'm gonna say he was the rich kid then."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Whatever, now he's really silent, I feel like, and he's never showin' emotion. It feels someways sad lookin' at him..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "He got slammed in here for six years, after all. It'd do a number like that on even the cheeriest kid."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "I s'pose so..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#3",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "So we just need to help him escape, and he'll be back to the way he was before, for sure."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "More or less, right? Eh, I'd pass on him becoming a rich kid again, though!"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "I think it'd be swell."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Okay, okay. You lost me now."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#5",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "If you wanna put it like that, you're losing me. You said you only came to help Anthony 'cause a friend trusted you to. Why would you go so far to help your Silence friend?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Because I think Silence is a good person."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "What kind of reason is that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Mmnnn... me and Silence know each other from one time she went out to do field work."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Me, I was used to pretty grubby methods to do my stuff. So happened I bumped into her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Guess I made some pretty un-small trouble for her back then. I drove her an inch from giving up her business there."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "But things worked out. And in the end, I got to know her. Can't knock 'em until you knock 'em, right? Do they say that?"
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Anyways, after that, she'd show me some work pretty often. Felt like she was hoping I'd do things proper like she did."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_440_Pinecone"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "She sounds like a real good person."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Sure as heck is. Always felt Silence saw this world a little too rosy, though."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Turns out there's a lotta things people who think like her can't ever make headway on."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Okay, maybe Silence is a little naive. But she's so smart. And she ain't stubborn. So I've always felt she's fine the way she is. I wanna be friends with her."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "I may have plenty of friends, but I only got one like Silence. I really cherish her, y'know."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "So that's why you went to prison to help her?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Eh. That's not all of it."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Another part's I once heard about this prison. Definitely been curious about this place."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Another 'nother part's... 'cause Silence kinda changed this time."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "You mean her gettin' you to help someone jailbreak?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Mmm. And she begged me to help her get all this corporate intel together. I picture how Silence used to be and it doesn't fit with her doing this kinda stuff."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Hm... did somethin' happen to her, you think?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "I dunno... ever since she left Columbia and went to some shop called Rhodes Island, I never saw her again. Been stuck with pen-palling."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Never really made clear why she left Columbia either... but, yeah, I guess something musta happened."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "In any case, Silence seems real dead-set on this, so I figure I'll help her out proper for once."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Kafka. Hear me out. You might be a real good person yourself?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Eh? You're saying you saw me as some stinker?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#2",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "I seem to remember you good-Kafka-bad-Kafkain' me straight into prison with you, y'know..."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#3",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 1
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Ahah. Imagine if I asked a stranger outta nowhere 'hey, let's get locked up together.' Don't matter how I ask, they'd think I was going nuts, right. So I needed a little more of an approach, yannow?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#3",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Yep. I cannot out-words you. Forget it."
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4"
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "Heehee. No, but anyways, I just don't think this is really a 'good or bad' kinda thing."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "It's like how you're going all neck or nothing for the guy who once saved your family, but what you're actually doing is breaking him outta jail."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "If saying it's for a friend makes it kind for sure, then maybe more of my friends are good people than the ones who just put on the looks."
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Kafka",
        "text": "But people who do bad stuff even though they have good intentions... how do you call them good people, huh?"
    },
    {
        "command": "character",
        "params": {
            "name": "char_214_kafka_1#4",
            "name2": "char_440_Pinecone",
            "focus": 2
        }
    },
    {
        "command": "name",
        "value": "Mina",
        "text": "Hm... I think you have a point."
    },
